      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53df175f675564659945557a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "冲过来了，%a_horse1",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7885914bbb4100051bcf4232ad1ff149c3c3adea638efa3a55279e7e7a1d829",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1303"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da15ce5381e6e3e3706f461e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "太阳已经完全落山，%course\n%ground%distance%race\n%h_num_no赛马娘前来挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "0049a0df7c7ec72cf76b152845fa476e9122d97501d3265a49c16bb275e67689",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1305"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a1a61e62f1c4d09ec5230d1",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在夜空中繁星的注视下，%course\n%ground%distance%race\n%h_num_no赛马娘前来挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6edcaf68be9e38304e3aa63896ecb5354d336254a57db76e78a92490b51186b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1306"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cee4562ab33ff8ed057fa3a0",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在星空之下举行，%course\n%ground%distance%race\n%h_num_no赛马娘前来挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "fed58bdf69d4f0339466950786b85e51c86ed7536c4e4d796e001c4c295a4829",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1307"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6426c00e8bd98a5446546992",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "笼罩夜空的乌云营造了紧张氛围\n%course%ground%distance\n%race\n%h_num_no赛马娘前来挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "419c53d5cbe66cbf908a1a6628cb524602c7ee39313883919c315382cc5f1d49",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1308"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee1301fc02c0826062759793",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "雨点在光照下闪闪发光，%course\n%ground%distance%race\n%h_num_no赛马娘前来挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "04a4ee0988b7d3a382f0de69946cb3e3bf9798925edf119fbf00b9a57674d775",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1309"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:826acacb8c0551277f2d2a4e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "人气第一，%a_h_pop1，很快取得领先",
      "source_fingerprint": "9aa4a7d805ad4e421c1a4b6c7dc13db5cac6cdbfe65e5625687922f334164b72",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:424bee9398776bab20e83a04",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "夜雨使人有一种动荡不安的预感，%course\n%ground%distance%race\n%h_num_no赛马娘前来挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cbb42ccf95f593ae79ef4038416ceef7a9cd5a9613e39f9f6a952b0251e1198",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1310"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:305e3793b49347b4a92f26f3",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "能够取得沙之王者宝座的，是哪位赛马娘呢\n上半年沙土冠军决定战，帝王赏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bcf5441779e677e036ae65df72b0884bc51a29e46654a96ae8be0d5728b10ba",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1d10841c7d1855c41ffce01",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "能作为沙之王者君临天下的会是哪位赛马娘呢\n新生沙土之王决定战，日本沙土德比！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f522950a435b075f73a8fbf300b59eee504a2f3b4fac329b82d9be66ddedb447",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1312"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d1ba52d87fbc4bbbcfbbe5f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "新的女主角将会在大井诞生\n沙之女王決定战，JBC雌马经典赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a354ddd193dbb93f2f2a482e4c1035bcc47145d0f8a02018f57bc13dd7d4f3d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1313"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:362ce4b3ef70a63ed5309832",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "大井竞马场里卷起了沙之疾风\n沙土比赛的速度决战，JBC短途赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "292414177b819492aceccea8e41ec758c1dbc72a4615cf7a250457526b978997",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1314"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95bc23ca5e6a204f86bebf2d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "沙土上的强者在此聚集\n沙土比赛的巅峰决战，JBC经典赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6af3f8d039f940d200c1b13c09daf44e418d20b38beb497e11bafb3a260bff43",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1315"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d64c9453b84e24e3976bf2e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "沙土巧者们集中于十二月的大井赛场！\n沙土比赛的总决赛，东京大赏典！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc4e8c9b723d0f42beb6d87c06190bbaab55b4510e3ff0df73126938308e733c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1316"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82769f16ae81850ccfb305a6",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "大井的夜空之下，赛马娘们将化作\n闪耀的一等星，飞奔而出",
      "source_fingerprint": "574c8c371cc1ea5ff5b2b4fe32214a4250b6b834c91fff598db12d89e953c536",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1317"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb70a0bb828453a8c81de9d2",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "像是要照亮落日后的大井竞马场一样，\n赛马娘们将展现一场绝妙的奔跑",
      "source_fingerprint": "be919adf3a0cacf2ab5296bac6e388cedf53c32e7300b808f88a2fc4fc1df82e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1318"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecbc1d586c4d413261e2c72d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "辉煌的灯光照耀着大井竞马场\n赛马娘们准备疾驰",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1f3747ff30b5bf1308e137c3c917f8d8dcdb378242d8389d280e569d4c9baec",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1319"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19594502c64af36c12d705a9",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_pop1要跑在最前面吗",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0ff72760f194eb225d43675f2cc83d826f78ef67b1e50cd732fb4d5af923f95",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "132"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b99f0be96db66c4d882d312",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "夜空被乌云掩盖，\n赛马娘们会在大井的赛道上\n展示流星一般的绝妙奔跑",
      "source_fingerprint": "14bd4086b1b54f59e67ad9b0903929e9235592af583277ab06801ea84007674e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1320"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7732576de9a4b6668f72f3d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在月光也无法穿透的糟糕天气下，\n赛马娘们拿出驱散乌云的气势\n准备飞驰",
      "source_fingerprint": "02c96b207b849253262c312780c4ba6e004d70a1642a30f8340ea411b600e37a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1321"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:872329ea03d241b4875afed7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "明光下的南关东第一直线\n赛马娘将在此飞驰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "810cc1aa2c7b330afc4f7453cac36b334c31646d2dbde10eacd9a2596d3de634",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1322"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be2cb3470e96d3149e3a858f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "赛马娘们将在以长度为荣的地方竞马场，\n大井赛场的直线上奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5616547ccfa3957927a99e7e0cbf665f420ea66ab70fd8f2714a9bb9307af5cb",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1323"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fb2d3a8f8ef3bd478779981",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1！\n精彩地制霸了帝王赏\n登上沙之王者的宝座！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4444c3823de5b9d95e96b85d0d857badb52df437243baaad7e9e25fbb195d39",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1324"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a77a5b06a1600c9c49785c92",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "新一代沙之王者诞生，%h_rank_l1！\n作为沙土界的新星，\n成功铭刻下了她的名字！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e6c79c6f72a8d1dff02b7083a47f8134c523d5965d6ad1182fd0216e170f510",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1325"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fddb9adf8f26c60b4e570ef",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1！\n在年末最重要的赛事上\n成功夺得了沙土冠军的荣誉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7e5ed35d20667491e9c2f738e3f5d7b8890d9ca240c3cf0c2dc20dba311b7f6",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1326"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e3414351832b813f77cde06",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1！\nJBC经典赛制胜，\n在沙土界的顶点闪耀着光芒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4836730368149cf10a703ecb9e9f43fb839d8be3075a1d3b447eb7f7194742fd",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1327"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54ddc62e45add69f5dfe1e91",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1！\nJBC短途赛制胜，\n令我们见识到了沙土上最快的速度！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f361a48965ef34bcfe23ae84f00776eb6dd7d427cbcb4f475633b690c775b267",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1328"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d398a5df22b30137a8e0854",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1！\nJBC雌马经典赛制胜，\n作为沙之女王将自己的名字刻于历史！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cca145725eba39654c0481ae714e04c9949550b052e7cf8df36725ddc84a35b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1329"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9724ca27d780fe2466084a01",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "果然，%a_h_pop1",
      "source_fingerprint": "43d01e408f6d4fe142669a0058256634aab654519fe6c183e3220d79b1e8b885",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "133"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62d69ade521d5552db496621",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%horse1！\n好强的脚力！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2af05d98a7bc2a2e38c0a4d2f3c0db8e528270d940f728471d0301435b33373c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1330"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0db0c1a46fe2d9b174298f35",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%horse1！\n激烈的追赶！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "197cdd6cb8df5c09683b145d83e8624a20a4542c41ca4894f615b9dc8a31aabd",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1331"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8163faa124f2311fa09e8103",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%horse1！　惊人的末脚！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca5baa2df5272d9eac9b1b3a9b3b5f43795cf84d46d3c941eb036d8705519f02",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1332"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75c3ad8231f93c962c2b39c7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "这是想立于领先之位的气势！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e14b4a1d6eeb0a7cca727890f02e617a879a97b0ec9784160801a84535a39a27",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1333"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f74329735b97d5cfc0e3b0d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
